<title>USA: Fidelity Magellan declares year-end distribution.</title>
<headline>Fidelity Magellan declares year-end distribution.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Investments said Friday its Magellan Fund had a fiscal year-end distribution of $2.21 per share.</p>
<p>The distribution for the year ended March 31 includes $1.46 per share for long-term capital gains and $0.75 per share for income.</p>
<p>((Boston bureau (617) 367-4176))</p>
</text>
